                'en' => "Yes, if you have not paid anything and the work has not started, you can cancel and it happens right away, at no cost. Please note that this cannot be undone: you would need to make a new ticket if you change your mind. I can help you cancel it now.",
                'tl' => "Opo, kung wala pa kayong nababayaran at hindi pa nagsisimula ang trabaho, maaari kayong magkansela at agad itong mangyayari, walang bayad. Pakitandaan po na hindi na ito mababawi: kailangan ninyong gumawa ng bagong ticket kung magbago ang isip ninyo. Matutulungan ko po kayong ikansela ito ngayon.",
                'next' => ['luma_os_refund_how', 'luma_os_refund_rule'],
                'handler' => 'refund_flow',
            ],

            'luma_os_half_paid_cancel' => [
                'b' => 8, 'title' => 'Cancel after paying half', 'title_tl' => 'Kanselahin pagkatapos ng kalahati',
                'say' => [
                    'en'  => ['i paid half can i cancel', 'cancel after paying the first half', 'refund my first half', 'i paid the first half and want out', 'i already paid half what about my money', 'cancel after half payment'],
                    'tl'  => ['kalahati pa lang ang nabayad ko pwede bang magkansela', 'magkansela pagkatapos ng unang kalahati', 'i-refund ang unang kalahati ko', 'nabayaran ko na ang unang kalahati gusto ko nang umatras', 'nakabayad na ako ng kalahati paano ang pera ko', 'kansela pagkatapos ng half payment'],
                    'mix' => ['nagbayad ako half pwede cancel', 'refund ng first half ko po', 'half paid na pero gusto ko mag cancel', 'cancel after half payment po', 'first half ko paano', 'umatras na ako after half'],
                ],
                'kw' => 'paid half&cancel, half&cancel, half&refund, first half&refund, first half&cancel, unang kalahati&refund, unang kalahati&kansel, kalahati&kansel, kalahati&refund, half payment&cancel, half payment&refund, half paid&cancel, half paid&refund, umatras, umurong, paid half, nagbayad&half, nabayaran&half, nabayaran&kalahati, paid half&money, half&money, first half&how',
                'en' => "If you paid the first half and want to cancel, the same rule applies. If the work has not started, you can send a request, and if our team confirms it before work starts, the full amount you paid is sent back. If the work has started, it is usually non-refundable, but you can still send a request for our team to review. I can start the request with you now.",
                'tl' => "Kung nabayaran na ang unang kalahati at gusto ninyong magkansela, pareho po ang patakaran. Kung hindi pa nagsisimula ang trabaho, maaari kayong magpadala ng request, at kung kukumpirmahin ito ng aming team bago magsimula ang trabaho, ibabalik ang buong halagang binayaran ninyo. Kung nagsimula na, karaniwang hindi na ito refundable, pero maaari pa rin kayong magpadala ng request para suriin ng aming team. Matutulungan ko po kayong simulan ang request ngayon.",
                'next' => ['luma_os_refund_how', 'luma_os_partial_refund', 'luma_os_work_started_meaning'],
                'handler' => 'refund_flow',
            ],

            'luma_os_partial_refund' => [
                'b' => 8, 'title' => 'Partial refund', 'title_tl' => 'Bahagyang refund',
                'say' => [
                    'en'  => ['can i get a partial refund', 'refund only some of my payment', 'do you do partial refunds', 'can i get part of my money back', 'refund the unused part', 'half refund'],
                    'tl'  => ['pwede bang bahagyang refund', 'ibalik lang ang parte ng bayad ko', 'may partial refund ba kayo', 'pwede bang ibalik ang bahagi ng pera ko', 'i-refund ang hindi nagamit', 'kalahating refund'],
                    'mix' => ['partial refund pwede ba', 'may partial refund po ba', 'ibalik part lang ng payment ko', 'refund ng unused part pwede', 'half refund po', 'part ng money ko pwede ibalik'],
                ],
                'kw' => 'partial refund, partial&refund, part&refund, some&refund, bahagyang refund, bahagi&refund, parte&refund, refund&part, refund&unused, unused&refund, part of my money, part ng money, kalahating refund, half refund, ibalik&parte, ibalik&bahagi, refund&some, only some, refund&some&payment, hindi nagamit, nagamit, return&part, return&parte, part&money, return&part&payment',
                'en' => "We do not offer partial refunds. A request is either for the full amount you paid, when the work has not started, or it is reviewed by our team when the work has already started. If you want to talk about your situation, please contact our team. {{contact}}",
                'tl' => "Hindi po kami nag-aalok ng bahagyang refund. Ang request po ay para sa buong halagang binayaran ninyo kung hindi pa nagsisimula ang trabaho, o susuriin ng aming team kung nagsimula na ito. Kung gusto ninyong pag-usapan ang sitwasyon ninyo, kontakin po ang aming team. {{contact}}",
